---
// HeroChat.astro: the paged example message threads shown in the right-hand
// panel of both Hero.astro (homepage) and HeroLocal.astro (/northern-ireland/).
// Keeping it in one place means the threads, styles and paging script only
// need editing once. The threads mix questions from prospects with exchanges
// from existing clients, and they are placeholders: swap them for real
// (anonymised, with permission) exchanges when you have them. Without
// JavaScript all the threads simply stack, so nothing is hidden from anyone.
// With JavaScript the panel advances by itself, and stops for good as soon as
// a visitor picks a thread, hovers or focuses it, or prefers reduced motion.
---

<div class="hero-chat" role="group" aria-label="Examples of message exchanges with clients and prospects">
  <div class="hero-chat-bar">
    <span class="hero-chat-avatar" aria-hidden="true">C</span>
    <div class="hero-chat-who">
      <span class="hero-chat-name">Chris</span>
      <span class="hero-chat-sub">WP Base</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-chat-screens">
    <div class="hero-chat-screen is-active">
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Is it just updates you do, or full redesigns too?</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">09:05</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
        <p>Both. The monthly plan covers updates, backups and security, and I design and build new sites when you need one.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">09:11</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Good, I'd rather have one person for all of it.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">09:12</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-chat-screen">
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Hi Chris, my phone is showing a security warning when I open our website. Have we been hacked?</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">09:12</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
        <p>Not hacked. Your SSL certificate expired overnight. I've renewed it, so have another look and the warning should be gone.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">09:16</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>All fine now. Thanks, that was quick!</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">09:17</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-chat-screen">
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Do you do SEO as well?</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">11:40</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
        <p>Yes. I look after the technical side, like speed and Search Console errors, and Platinum adds a quarterly SEO review.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">11:46</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Brilliant, that's one less agency to chase.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">11:47</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-chat-screen">
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>I saw a news story about a WordPress plugin getting hacked. Is that one of ours?</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">08:41</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
        <p>It was, but I patched it first thing this morning and checked the site over afterwards. Nothing for you to do.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">08:47</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Brilliant. I'll go back to pretending I never saw the headline.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">08:48</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-chat-screen">
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Do I have to move my hosting to you?</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">15:20</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
        <p>No, you keep your own hosting account and I work with whoever you're already with.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">15:24</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>Great, I'd rather not move anything.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">15:25</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-chat-screen">
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>I think I've just deleted our Services page by mistake. Please tell me it's backed up.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">14:03</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
        <p>It is. I've restored last night's version and the page is back live now.</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">14:09</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
        <p>You've just saved my afternoon. Thank you!</p>
        <span class="hero-chat-time">14:10</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-chat-pager" role="group" aria-label="Choose an example conversation">
    <button type="button" class="hero-chat-dot is-active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Show example 1 of 6"></button>
    <button type="button" class="hero-chat-dot" aria-label="Show example 2 of 6"></button>
    <button type="button" class="hero-chat-dot" aria-label="Show example 3 of 6"></button>
    <button type="button" class="hero-chat-dot" aria-label="Show example 4 of 6"></button>
    <button type="button" class="hero-chat-dot" aria-label="Show example 5 of 6"></button>
    <button type="button" class="hero-chat-dot" aria-label="Show example 6 of 6"></button>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const chat = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.hero-chat');

  if (chat) {
    const screens = Array.from(chat.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.hero-chat-screen'));
    const dots = Array.from(chat.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.hero-chat-dot'));
    const INTERVAL = 8000;

    chat.classList.add('is-js');

    let current = 0;
    let timer: number | undefined;
    let stopped = false;   // the visitor took control, so never autoplay again
    let hovering = false;
    let onScreen = true;

    const show = (index: number) => {
      current = index;
      screens.forEach((screen, i) => screen.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index));
      dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
        dot.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index);
        if (i === index) {
          dot.setAttribute('aria-current', 'true');
        } else {
          dot.removeAttribute('aria-current');
        }
      });
    };

    const clear = () => {
      if (timer !== undefined) {
        window.clearTimeout(timer);
        timer = undefined;
      }
    };

    const schedule = () => {
      clear();
      if (stopped || hovering || !onScreen || document.hidden) return;
      timer = window.setTimeout(() => {
        show((current + 1) % screens.length);
        schedule();
      }, INTERVAL);
    };

    const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    if (reduceMotion) stopped = true;

    dots.forEach((dot, i) =>
      dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
        stopped = true;
        clear();
        show(i);
      })
    );

    // Hovering or tabbing into the panel pauses it, so nobody loses their place.
    chat.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => { hovering = true; clear(); });
    chat.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
    chat.addEventListener('focusin', () => { hovering = true; clear(); });
    chat.addEventListener('focusout', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });

    document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);

    if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
      new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        onScreen = entries[entries.length - 1].isIntersecting;
        schedule();
      }, { threshold: 0.3 }).observe(chat);
    }

    schedule();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .hero-chat {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    background: var(--midnight);
    color: var(--snow);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(8, 12, 24, 0.25);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-chat-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .hero-chat-avatar {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--midnight);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero-chat-who {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .hero-chat-name {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-chat-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  /* Without JavaScript the screens just stack. With it, they share one grid
     cell so the card keeps the height of the tallest thread and never jumps. */
  .hero-chat-screen {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-chat.is-js .hero-chat-screens {
    display: grid;
  }

  .hero-chat.is-js .hero-chat-screen {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    visibility: hidden;
  }

  .hero-chat.is-js .hero-chat-screen.is-active {
    visibility: visible;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg {
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg--client {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg--chris {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--midnight);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
  }

  .hero-chat-time {
    display: block;
    margin-block-start: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-align: right;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .hero-chat-pager {
    display: none;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-chat.is-js .hero-chat-pager {
    display: flex;
  }

  .hero-chat-dot {
    position: relative;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .hero-chat-dot::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset-block: calc(50% - 4px);
    inset-inline: calc(50% - 4px);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, inset-inline 0.2s ease;
  }

  .hero-chat-dot:hover::before {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }

  .hero-chat-dot.is-active::before {
    inset-inline: calc(50% - 10px);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-chat-dot:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero-chat:not(.is-js) .hero-chat-msg,
    .hero-chat.is-js .hero-chat-screen.is-active .hero-chat-msg {
      animation: hero-chat-in 0.45s ease-out both;
    }

    .hero-chat-msg:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .hero-chat-msg:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
    .hero-chat-msg:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 2.1s; }
  }

  @keyframes hero-chat-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
